[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なぜだ、なぜ、届かん……\nあの日から今日まで、この瞬間の、ため、に……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why... why can't I overcome you... Everything from that day until now, was all for this moment..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "死後の世にて汝の子と相まみえよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go now to the afterlife and be reunited with your child."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コウセン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kosen"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……これでけじめはつけた。\nさらばだ、コウセンよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...This settles our account. Farewell, Kosen."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……コウセン。\nお前のことは今後も忘れることはないだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Kosen. I will never forget you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "人の上に立つ者として、散っていった者の想いも\nすべて背負う。それが余の覚悟だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As one who rules over others, I will carry the feelings of all those who have fallen. That is my resolve."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "背負う……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Carry..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっとゴゥ、大丈夫よね？\n私と同じ、ホムンクルスでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey Gou, you're okay, right? You're a homunculus like me, aren't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おぉ……ナナに心配してもらえるとは\n兄は嬉しいぞ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... to have Nana worry about me... that truly makes this brother happy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "軽口を叩けるなら大丈夫……と言いたいとこだけど、\nまだ身体が思うように動かないようだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'd like to say you're fine if you can still crack jokes, but it looks like your body still isn't responding properly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "港のバーバラ号へ運びましょう。\nトトリが治療薬の準備をしているはずですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We should take him to the Barbara at the harbor. Totori should have treatment medicine prepared."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "手を貸す必要はない。これくらい自分でなんとかする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't need help. I can handle this much myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "好意を無下に断るのは無粋ってもんさ。\nこの場は甘えておきな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rudely refusing kindness is uncouth. You should accept their help for now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……姉上がそう仰るなら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...If you say so, sister."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "バーバラ号まで案内するね！\nこういうのは案内人に任せて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll guide you to the Barbara!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと沁みますよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This might sting a little?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……っ！\u3000問題は、ない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! Not a problem."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これで、しばらく安静にしていれば大丈夫です。\nすぐに痺れは消えると思います",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There, if you rest for a while, you should be fine. The numbness should go away soon."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "弟が世話になったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "On behalf of my brother, sorry for imposing on you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえいえ！\u3000他にも治療が必要な人はいますか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not at all! Are there any other people who need treatment?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……今回は不覚を取ったな。まだ鍛え方が足りんらしい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I let my weakness get the better of me this time. It seems I still need more training."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イェルカもゴゥも騒ぎすぎ。僕らはホムンクルスだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka and Gou are making such a fuss. We're homunculi."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "シトリン、その言い方は感心しません。もっと自分を\n大切にしてください。後で家族会議……っとと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine, I don't approve of that attitude. You should value yourself more. We'll have a family meeting later... ah."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今は回復のことだけ考えるようにしな。\nシトリンも、ゴゥを煽るようなことを言うんじゃないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just focus on recovering for now. And Citrine, don't say things to provoke Gou."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はーい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Okay."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（思ったのと違う展開……\n\u3000なーんか、調子狂っちゃうよ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This didn't go like I expected... This is really throwing me off.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]